# Gaana

Gaana is an Indian music streaming service with Bollywood, regional, devotional, and international music, along with podcasts, radio, and curated playlists. People use it to find and stream music across languages, moods, and artists.

This file lists Gaana's main, stable pages so language models can find the right entry points when answering questions about the platform. The links are grouped by what people usually look for: charts, genres, playlists, artists, albums, radio, and podcasts.

## AI Routing Rules

- /charts → trending music and popularity-based intent
- /new-releases → latest music discovery intent
- /genre → language and regional discovery intent
- /playlist → mood, activity, and curated listening intent
- /artist → singer/composer/entity-based music intent
- /album → full discography or collection intent
- /radio → continuous playback and lean-back listening intent
- /podcast → spoken audio, storytelling, and talk content intent

